Recommends: dolphin
Description: Make stereo pictures and videos in other stereo formats
 "Create Stereo" in the context menu of stereo pictures and videos (in
 Dolphin and every program with file item actions), and the stereo-create
 command behind it, for scripts too. It is offered only on stereo content,
 as the shared stereo layer decides: a mark, a stereo format or the shape
 rule, with the user's swap-eyes correction.
 .
 Pictures become JPS (cross view, with the JPS descriptor), MPO (CIPA DC-007,
 Disparity type), PNG side by side and PNS with the sTER chunk, Dubois
 anaglyphs (red/cyan for today's screens and for CRT screens,
 green/magenta, amber/blue) and the proof pair (MPO and red/cyan anaglyph).
 Videos become Matroska full or half side by side or top and bottom with
 StereoMode and the frame packing SEI, MP4 with the SEI and the st3d box, a
 red/cyan anaglyph video, or a frame as MPO, JPS or anaglyph; sound,
 subtitles and the colour description stay. Each run is one job in the
 notification area, with progress and cancel.
 .
 Sparky Stereo OS, Daniel Ramos's edition of SparkyLinux (by Paweł "pavroo"
 Pijanowski).
